  "id": "asian-inspired-spaghetti-salad",
  "name": "Asian-Inspired Spaghetti Salad",
  "subtitle": "Chilled spaghetti with a tangy sesame dressing and crisp vegetables.",
  "description": "Toss cooked spaghetti with a sweet-tangy soy dressing, sesame seeds, green onions, bell pepper, and snap peas, then chill before serving.",
